    {
      "id": "seed|2957502|12",
      "text": "有採集隊從城外回來說，霜林靠近城側的那片最近長得特別快",
      "source": "event_seed",
      "source_score": 2,
      "weight": 3,
      "updated_at": 1774501498,
      "expires_at": 1774505098
    },
    {
      "id": "seed|2957498|20",
      "text": "樓頂的蓄水設施今天開始例行清洗，水量可能會少一會兒",
      "source": "event_seed",
      "source_score": 2,
      "weight": 1,
      "updated_at": 1774499097,
      "expires_at": 1774502697
    },
